CATCAS_SERIES_PARALLEL_RELATION 1
TYPE BOOLEAN_F3
NODE V EXTERNAL
NODE B EXTERNAL
NODE T INTERNAL
NODE X INTERNAL
NODE Y INTERNAL
RELATION R_VX V X 0 1 2 0
RELATION R_XT X T 0 1 2 0
RELATION R_VY V Y 0 1 2 0
RELATION R_YT Y T 0 1 2 0
RELATION R_TB T B 0 1 2 0
ELIMINATE X
ELIMINATE Y
ELIMINATE T
END
